Package: jmvdoe
Type: Package
Title: Design of Experiments and Analysis
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Jake", "Merrell", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "jake.merrell@xonano.com")
Author: Jake Merrell
Maintainer: Jake Merrell <jake.merrell@xonano.com>
Description: Generate designed experiments (DOE) in jamovi and analyze the
    measured results. Includes full factorial, screening (regular fractions and
    Plackett-Burman), response surface (central composite and Box-Behnken),
    custom D- and I-optimal, and Taguchi orthogonal arrays. After the
    experiment, fit regression / ANOVA or Taguchi signal-to-noise models,
    with effect summary, SN delta and rank, predicted SN, plots, and
    preferred settings.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
